-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{input}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为输入数据量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{uplink}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ink</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为上行带宽。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{edge} &lt; T_{local}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且边缘有空闲算力时选择卸载。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算力网络与算网融合\">算力网络与算网融合</h3><p>算力网络是中国通信产业提出的前沿概念——将网络从单纯的数据传输管道进化为感知计算需求、调度算力资源的智能平台：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>算力感知</strong>：网络能够发现并标识分布式算力节点的可用资源</li>\n<li><strong>算力路由</strong>：根据算力需求将计算任务路由到最合适的算力节点</li>\n<li><strong>算网一体</strong>：用户无感知地获得&quot;算力+网络&quot;的一体化服务</li>\n</ul>\n<p>技术实现路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>近期：通过DNS调度和Anycast实现基本的算力分配</li>\n<li>中期：基于SRv6的算力标识和转发编程</li>\n<li>远期：原生算力网络协议栈，计算和网络统一编排</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>5G-Advanced（5.5G）正在标准化阶段，进一步增强URLLC场景至0.5ms延迟和99.9999%可靠性，同时引入通感一体化能力（通信与雷达感知融合），为自动驾驶和低空经济提供网络基础。</p>\n<p>AI原生网络（AI-Native Network）概念强调AI不再是网络的附加优化工具，而是网络架构设计的内生要素——网络自身具备感知、决策、执行的智能闭环能力，实现自规划、自配置、自优化、自愈合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>使用free5GC或Open5GS开源项目搭建一个5G核心网实验环境，理解AMF/SMF/UPF各网元的交互流程</li>\n<li>设计一个智慧工厂的网络切片方案：为生产控制（URLLC）、视频监控（eMBB）和设备管理（mMTC）分配切片参数和SLA指标</li>\n<li>使用MQTT协议搭建一个温湿度监控系统（Mosquitto Broker + ESP32传感器 + Grafana可视化），体验IoT端到端数据链路</li>\n<li>计算题：某AR眼镜应用需要处理30fps的高清视频帧（每帧2MB），本地GPU处理延迟15ms，上传到MEC（上行100Mbps）处理延迟3ms，网络传输延迟多少时边缘处理优于本地？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>5G以服务化架构和网络切片技术为万物互联提供了差异化的无线连接基础，IoT协议生态覆盖了从高速率到低功耗的全场景设备接入需求，边缘计算将算力推向数据产生的位置实现超低延迟响应和带宽优化。三者的融合构建了一个&quot;连接无处不在、算力随取随用&quot;的新型数字基础设施。网络工程师需要理解这些技术的架构原理和部署实践，才能在智能制造、自动驾驶、智慧城市等产业场景中设计和运维下一代网络系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"5G与物联网边缘计算","id":"5g与物联网边缘计算"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"5G网络架构","id":"5g网络架构"},{"level":3,"text":"网络切片技术","id":"网络切片技术"},{"level":3,"text":"IoT通信协议","id":"iot通信协议"},{"level":3,"text":"边缘计算（MEC）","id":"边缘计算-mec"},{"level":3,"text":"算力网络与算网融合","id":"算力网络与算网融合"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SDN与NFV架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/cloud-network-emerging-tech/sdn-nfv-architecture"},"next":null}